    "title": "Head softball coach Meeks departs Pearl River CC for role on South Alabama staff - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cody Heaster ,\n8 hours ago POPLARVILLE, Miss. (WLOX) — Christie Meeks has accepted an associate head coach position at South Alabama, leaving Pearl River Community College after seven seasons that culminated in the program’s first NJCAA Softball National Championship. Meeks, who grew up in Mobile, Alabama, returns home after compiling a 234-93 record... Read full article",
